OL,3,GNEWSA'The day he nearly killed me is
OL,4,Athe day that he saved my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The day he nearly killed me is the day
OL,7,Fthat he saved my life - because I ended
OL,8,Fup here."
OL,10,FMichaela - not her real name - is
OL,11,Ftalking about the moment she and her
OL,12,Fson arrived at a refuge run by
OL,13,FSheffield Women's Aid.
OL,15,FAfter suffering years of domestic
OL,16,Fabuse, during which she tried to take
OL,17,Fher own life, she said the secure
OL,18,Ffacility had been both "rock bottom"
OL,19,Fand a launch pad to reclaim her life.
OL,21,F"I didn't realise I was in an abusive
OL,22,Frelationship for years," she said.
